cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this firmware, please cite the paper listed in preferred-citation."
title: "BLWST: Battery-Less Wireless Sensor Tag for Railway Track Monitoring"
abstract: >-
  Firmware for a battery-less wireless sensor tag (BLWST) based on the Texas
  Instruments CC430F5137 and an ADXL362 accelerometer. The sensor node measures
  track vibration and transmits an 8-byte packet over a 433 MHz RF link; the
  receiver forwards the three-axis data over UART.
